This file describes the directives and concepts tested by this test set.

test set name: age_verify02

directives:

  rtems_age_set_bracket
  rtems_age_get_signal

concepts:

+ Test parsing of string-based Date of Birth (DOB) input for headless CI automation.
+ Test age calculation logic against a fixed reference date to map to statutory age brackets (e.g., AB-1043).
+ Test secure provisioning of the calculated bracket into the operating system.
+ Test stack memory zeroing of sensitive intermediate DOB data to prevent local memory leakage.
+ Test retrieval and accurate translation of the statutory signal for third-party application consumption.